WEBVTT

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.680
I have a message
from my master.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.800
Would you like to hear it?

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.150
Mom's Shikigami came!

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.110
I got one, too.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.850
Me. Too.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.310
Me. Too.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:28.910
What?

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.710
Yoshimori.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:33.090
We need to talk before breakfast.
Come with me.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.130
What did Sumiko say?

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:41.240
She said that a big enemy
is coming,

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.730
but I shouldn't be hasty
when I deal with it.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:48.040
I see... The message she sent me
was a warning, too.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:52.150
It seems that she has
no intention of returning.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:53.880
That prodigal daughter...

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.110
And she also said that I should
cooperate with Big Brother...

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:02.790
I'm only telling this to you,
that Masamori has accepted a post

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.690
in the Shadow Organization's
Executive Committee.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:07.300
I don't like it either.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:11.390
But we may have to ask
for their help in the future.

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:14.230
When the time comes.
Do exactly as Masamori says.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.770
Do as he says? Why?

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.500
He's your older brother.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:21.010
We should cooperate more
with the Yukimuras

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:23.880
before we consider cooperating
with the Shadow Organization.

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:25.440
The Yukimuras?!

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:27.740
The Yukimuras have nothing
to do with this!

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:31.080
Why?! We should ask for their help
before we ask the Shadow Organization!

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.590
Our goals are the same!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.050
Silence!

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:39.550
A rift that has lasted four hundred years
cannot be mended easily.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:46.800
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:48.670
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:53.880
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.780
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:59.210
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:03.620
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.160
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.490
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:16.160
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.660
Sha la la la la...

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:27.080
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.040
(Secret romance)

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:34.250
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.010
(A strange distance)

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:42.860
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:43.930
Yeah

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.400
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:51.000
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:56.340
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:16.620
So it's finished...

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:21.200
It can't be mass-produced yet,
but it's several times more durable.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:23.860
Its time limit has also been increased.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:26.830
There should be no problems
with normal use.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.430
The eye color is the same as always
so sunglasses must be worn...

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:32.900
Do you want to try it?

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:36.830
No. Select the candidates
among your subordinates.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.840
You're sending them on
a suicide mission again?

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:43.050
It took me a long time to train Hisui.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:46.910
All right, next!

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.670
Wow.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.610
That's everyone.
Now come over here.

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:14.970
Select any outfit you want.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.190
What do you think of this?

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.590
I like this suit.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.950
How do you tie this belt?

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.690
So troublesome!

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:26.960
This is how you tie a necktie!

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.900
Don't get all carried away
just because you look human.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.630
Kaguro, are you sure about this?

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:35.390
You can move much faster
with the newer model.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:37.870
We're up against...
What was it. Kekkaishi?

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.700
It won't be as fun without
a handicap like this.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.400
The old model is fine with me.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.710
Is that part of your aesthetics?

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:48.440
Isn't that the most important thing?

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.410
Now, I will tell you how to use the skin
and rules you must adhere to over there.

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:58.160
Aihi... Why do you
research humans?

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.060
Do you also want to be human?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.660
Call me Aihi-san.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.130
How about Aihi-sama?

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:07.600
I'm not that important.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:10.200
You're so difficult.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:13.470
You come too.
Show some support for once.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.770
Yeah yeah...

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.450
I'll answer your question
from earlier...

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:27.610
Humans are nothing
but research subjects.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:34.050
That's it? You should be
more honest with yourself.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:46.610
A rift that has lasted four hundred years
cannot be mended easily.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:49.740
The rivalry between
Sumimura and Yukimura...

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.340
It's only about who's
the Legitimate Heir.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.640
Who cares about that?

00:05:56.920 --> 00:06:00.480
At least there isn't a rift
between Tokine and me...

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:01.880
Even yesterday...

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.420
- Wait!
- Shut Up!

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:05.350
- Toki...
- Shut up and do your job!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.830
No. Wait.
Yesterday was different.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.960
We used to be so close back
in the day.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:14.490
Yoshimori?

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:15.890
Yoshimori!

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:17.700
Yoshimori!

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.610
I'm surprised I'm still alive...

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:29.010
I mean...
Shouldn't I have better memories?

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.740
There has to be something...

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:35.880
Yoshimori!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.680
Keep it a secret.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:54.240
Awesome!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.910
Is that really fun?

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.510
Just let them do what they want...

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:11.290
How long have you been there?!

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.560
I wonder what's for lunch today?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.380
Awesome! This is awesome!

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:31.950
Sekia. Shut up for a minute.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.170
Come on. Sanan.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:36.710
We're under the sun!
I still can't believe it.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.050
Hey, this is called
a convenience store, right?

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:40.890
I want to try some ice cream.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.760
Shouldn't you be a bit more tense
in this situation?

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:45.460
We're almost at Karasumori.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:46.690
Yeah. All right...

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.290
KARASUMORI ACADEMY

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.290
Awesome... So this is Karasumori...

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.470
This place will be ours one day.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.930
All right. Let's go.

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:01.630
What's that?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.040
Are they new teachers?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:04.880
Are they someone's parents?

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.350
Maybe they're professional athletes.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:07.610
They're huge.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:15.320
Testing, testing. Mic check.

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:19.120
BROADCASTING ROOM
To everyone at Karasumori.
How do you do?

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:24.730
We're a bunch of suspicious people
and we're called the Kokuboro.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:28.760
But in truth, we only have business
with a couple of people here.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.460
Kokuboro?!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:31.840
How did they get in here?

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.700
I don't know!
I couldn't feel their presence!

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.870
Are they wearing human skin?!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.780
Schools are so nice.

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:44.910
There are so many humans
with soft flesh.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.220
But that's not our main purpose,

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.690
- so you can rest assured.
- Sorry.

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:51.220
We only want to talk.

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.260
Let's meet around 3.00 AM
at the usual place.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.520
We'll be waiting.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.470
Where's the broadcasting room?

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.450
On the right!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.590
They're in the yard!

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:09.310
So that's them...

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.080
- Don't!
- Are you going to let them go?

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.070
Yes!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.380
What would you do if
they were actually human?!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.220
You can find out

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:22.210
whether they're human or not
after you beat them.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:26.620
At the very least, they don't intend to
do anything during the day.

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:31.190
They will become stronger at night.
This is Karasumori.

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.300
What are you people?!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.870
We're just a hidden camera show.
Sorry.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.200
That's that.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:42.170
We can't get other people involved.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:45.900
As long as they don't hurt other students,
we shouldn't do anything to them.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.140
But isn't it too late if
we wait for someone to get hurt?

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.630
The sun is so warm.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:00.490
The only thing we knew was
the coldness of the moon.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:05.220
If we make Karasumori ours.
We can get all of this.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.330
That's right... Everything.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.100
One of them was the same
one we saw the other day.

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:17.700
So any of them can wear
the human skin?

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.370
Probably.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.040
Aside from the one with black hair.
They all smelled the same.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.310
The same? What do you mean?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.680
I don't know exactly.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:30.250
Either way, these enemies are
different from before.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:31.960
They introduced themselves
as the Kokuboro

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.220
when they came into the school.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.670
They walked through the front door

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:40.960
but we didn't notice until
they announced themselves.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:44.830
I'm going to ask Grandma
what we should do.

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.400
No... We should take care of this
on our own.

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:53.650
The five of them came together.
We have to cooperate, too.

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:56.610
Do you think Grampa Shige and
Grandma Toki can do that?

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:00.150
I guess not.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:03.850
Can you... cooperate with us?

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:12.790
Hey!

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.630
I have no intention of
abandoning my mission.

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.780
I think that's the best thing
he could say now.

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:29.280
Being blunt is the best he can do?

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.350
I feel like we have
a rocky future ahead of us!

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.950
That's only if we have a "future."

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:42.620
Here you go.

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.190
Sorry. I won't have time
to eat today.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:47.690
Oh, really?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:48.960
I'm off.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:59.110
There was one more
wearing human skin?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:01.440
Yeah. But the insides seemed different.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.580
And there's four more.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:08.120
They'll be a bit of a problem because
they don't give off Ayakashi scent.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:16.020
Tokine!

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.830
What were you doing?
They're already here!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.100
We still have some time until
we're supposed to meet.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:23.890
Where's Shishio?

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.370
You're late.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:30.870
Don't hide over there!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:32.550
What are you? A ninja?

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:37.320
Was he waiting for me?

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.080
Yoshimori! Let's go!

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.510
Yeah!

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:45.510
Does this look right?

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:48.060
Line up the corners.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.660
Is this what you want?

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:55.260
Stop bringing desks!

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:59.200
Chairs! Bring chairs!
The stuff you sit on!

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:00.940
You understand, don't you?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.080
They're taking stuff
from the school.

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:11.080
Hi.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:18.050
Oh man!
You're a bit early.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:19.980
What are you doing?

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:23.890
Huh? I was making
a place for us to talk.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.800
Hey!

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:27.770
I found something nice!

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:29.630
Where did you get that?

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:32.630
I found this in a place called
the "Principal's Office."

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:35.240
The tablecloth is from
the "Counseling Office."

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:36.370
Oh.

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:40.600
We aren't quite ready,
but we shouldn't keep them waiting.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:43.050
Let's start.

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:47.680
My guys keep bringing desks
so we don't have enough chairs.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.190
But anyway, find a seat.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:58.060
What is it?
Are you suspicious of us?

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:01.160
I told you we just want to talk.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.420
Liar!

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:06.970
Okay, Haizen-kun,
tell him our circumstances.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.400
Huh? Me?

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:11.440
I think you should put down
the desk now.

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:12.910
Oh... Yeah...

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:18.990
Umm... Oh...
Hmm... Ahem...

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:21.350
We... I...

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.620
No. Wait... Uhh. We...

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:25.120
Time's up.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.480
Next. Haroku.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.830
Uh... Ugh.

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:31.170
Oh. Come on...

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.860
- Me! Me!
- Okay, Sanan.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.030
We have one demand.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:39.800
You hand over Karasumori to us.

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:44.880
If you do so, we will not harm
any humans at this school.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.500
Correct. Good job!

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:49.720
Why did you skip my turn!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.720
You probably would have
said something stupid...

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.920
like "We are aliens
from outer space."

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.790
H-How did you know?

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:58.190
Sanan. Continue on
with your negotiations.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:02.350
You cannot refuse our demand.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:06.430
We have proven how easily
we can infiltrate this place.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:08.330
Sh-Shut up!

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:13.340
Even your mutts couldn't find us.

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:15.900
How dare he call us mutts!

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.140
I don't want to hear that
from an Ayakashi!

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:21.510
Then can you pick up
an Ayakashi scent coming from us?

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.240
Good! Keep going!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.180
You can only work at night.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:31.290
But we can be active during
the day in this human skin.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.550
How do you intend to stop us?

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.950
I'll destroy you on sight
the next time you enter the school!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.390
That's right! He can do it!

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.870
Yoshi is stronger than he looks.

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.570
"Than he looks"?

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.640
Then let us ask you one thing.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:49.310
What do you get out of
protecting this place?

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:53.180
What has this site done
for you humans?

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:57.280
It seems it might be a bit different
for you over there.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.650
Did he see through me?
That I'm Half-Ayakashi?

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.450
He might seem like a flake,
but he's the strongest!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:10.850
We don't hate humans.
You could say we love them.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.960
We even want to become human.

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:16.930
That's why we don't want to hurt them.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:21.670
What's the difference between humans
and us when we're wearing this skin?

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:23.440
Get away from them.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:26.940
Not good!

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:52.700
- Shishio!
- Gen-kun!

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:55.200
You're so young.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:05.270
- Shishio!
- Gen-kun!

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.490
But you're quite good.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:14.850
You broke off the tips
of my blades...

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.460
Here's a bonus.

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:19.290
- Hakubi!
- Madarao!

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:21.560
Why, you!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.530
I leave the rest up to you guys.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.030
Kaguro, are you really
not gonna help?

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.240
Hey, this chair doesn't look
too bad after all.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.440
Do you think you'll get away
with this?!

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.210
What are you going to
do about it?

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:48.490
I'll just watch from up here.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:52.030
That jerk! He's fooling around!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.560
Yoshimori... Look.

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:59.900
He's telling us that he could
kill us anytime he wants.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:04.000
I'll do it!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.650
So now it's negotiation by force?

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:10.720
Probably. Let's move into
phase two of the plan.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.650
Wait!

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.220
Don't move without thinking!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.870
They took Shishio!
I have to do something!

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:27.860
Look up!

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:39.970
What is this?!

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.140
You can't hit me with that!

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:45.910
No! We're being led into a trap!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:58.990
What is this?

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.190
This is what they were aiming for.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:04.030
Now let's resume negotiations.

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:09.170
I told you earlier, we want to
resolve this through conversation.

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:11.450
By the way, this magic square is...

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:13.440
Shut up! Where is Shishio?!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:17.610
He will be included
in the negotiation.

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:19.610
Ketsu!

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.510
The Kekkai...

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.920
I was about to explain it to you...

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:29.060
This is a Seal of Dispelling.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:32.130
You are just ordinary humans.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:33.790
You cannot cast a Kekkai in here.

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.190
Yoshimori...

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:46.010
It's dangerous so please stand
behind the black line.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.840
What's with those eyes?

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:54.880
Humans are supposed to use more
than plain words when negotiating...

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.280
Do it!

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.270
I thought you wanted to talk!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:12.170
I finally get to hear
those words from you.

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:15.610
Now, are you willing to hear us out?

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:16.830
Yoshimori.

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:19.040
I'll keep them busy.

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:21.070
You have to get outside the Kekkai.

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:22.410
- What are you?
- Listen to me!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:24.990
We can't use our techniques in here.

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:25.970
It's hopeless if we don't get out.

00:20:26.390 --> 00:20:30.820
If you can get out, we have a chance
to turn the tables.

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:35.220
We probably only have one chance.
Let's go!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.410
I know it won't work!

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:55.310
I just need them to focus on me.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.270
So that Yoshimori can!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:00.950
That's why I have to keep moving.

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:15.930
Yoshimori...

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:22.940
Stupid! I told you
we only had one chance!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:24.810
Shut up! I didn't agree to it!

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.240
Look at the situation!

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:28.480
Are you turning on each other?

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:31.670
Shishio got taken down...

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:35.910
I don't want to see anyone
get hurt again.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:39.150
How's your shoulder?

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:46.060
It's nothing.
Didn't you take a hit on your side?

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:47.730
This is nothing.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:50.500
Thanks to that.
It cleared my head.

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:53.810
Hey. About their seal...

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:55.330
How far do you think it extends?

00:21:56.910 --> 00:21:59.140
Do you want to take a chance
on my plan this time?

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:01.540
Let's go!

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:04.010
What are you trying to do?!

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:10.780
Tokine!

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:50.290
With a look on your face that says,
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:50.330 --> 00:22:53.560
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:57.730
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:01.330
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.580 --> 00:23:05.140
Trying to avoid an emergency,
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:09.110
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:13.180
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:13.220 --> 00:23:16.450
I am, it's common sense

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:20.790
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:26.770
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:33.100
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.070
(if that's true)

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:39.770
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:39.910 --> 00:23:43.210
Please Please Please

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:47.410
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:50.750
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:55.020
You watch from far away

00:23:55.060 --> 00:24:01.020
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:03.130
Hey Hey
